{"info":{"title":"Chain Chronicle: Haecceitas no Hikari Part 1","originalTitle":"Chain Chronicle: The Light of Haecceitas Part 1","synopsis":"Questa è la storia di Chain Chronicle, un libro che descrive tutto ciò che accade nel mondo. I cittadini del remoto continente di Yggd un tempo pensavano che non esistessero altre terre. Il continente era diviso in diverse regioni, ognuna con il suo re. Nonostante qualche scaramuccia, un signore, scelto da tutti i re, ha sempre mantenuto l'equilibrio -- finché non è giunto l'Esercito Nero. L'Esercito Volontario, comandato da Yuri, non può nulla contro l'Esercito Nero. Durante lo scontro, il Signore dei Neri ruba una metà di Chain Chronicle, oltre a conquistare la capitale. Durante la ritirata, Yuri e l'Esercito Volontario incontrano un ragazzo che combatte l'Esercito Nero da solo. Così inizia la storia di Chain Chronicle, dell'Esercito Volontario e dell'Esercito Nero che si scontrano per il destino del mondo, e dell'amicizia. Il film copre i primi 4 episodi della serie TV.","type":"movie","status":"completed","statusLabel":"Finito","audio":"Giapponese","dubbed":false,"releaseDateLabel":"03 Dicembre 2016","year":2016,"season":"Autunno 2016","studios":["Graphinica","Telecom Animation Film"],"genres":["Avventura","Azione","Fantasy","Magia","Shounen"],"durationLabel":"1h e 26 min","declaredEpisodeCount":1,"availableEpisodeCount":4,"rating":6.38,"ratingCount":193,"views":22191,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7yYxuZaIjus1RHgwpcTrtOMdgMe.jpg","shareImage":{"base":"img","path":"/locandine/82495l.jpg"},"sourceType":"Movie","tags":["Movie","Finito","2016"],"extra":{"ids":{"anilistIds":[20787,87505,87506],"malIds":[25431,33728,33729],"anidbIds":[10747,12291],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[415282,428294],"tmdbShowIds":[],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[314031]},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:87505","mal:33728"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10747","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"12291","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20787"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"87505","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"87506"},{"provider":"mal","id":"25431"},{"provider":"mal","id":"33728","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"33729"},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"415282","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"428294"},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314031","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"9"}}]},"metadataTargets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12291","scope":"R","raw":"anidb:12291:R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"87505","raw":"anilist:87505","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"33728","raw":"mal:33728","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"415282","raw":"tmdb_movie:415282","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314031","scope":"s0","raw":"tvdb_show:314031:s0","ranges":{"1":"9"}}],"sourceIds":{"anilist":87505,"mal":33728},"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":415282,"type":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/415282","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T19:39:26.983Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"Chain Chronicle: The Light of Haecceitas Movie 1","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"チェインクロニクル~ヘクセイタスの閃(ひかり)~ 第１章","overview":{"value":"Yuri has assembled the Volunteer Army in an effort to defeat the Black King, who threatens to destroy the land with his Black Army, corrupting miasma, and nihilistic attitude. All the forces from assorted powers and races across the land of Yggdra have rallied behind his cause, but at the critical moment in what should be the final battle, Yuri and his allies are defeated by the Black King, the magical Chain Chronicle which records the history of the land is torn in half, and their sprite companion Pirika, who is the embodiment of the world's will, vanishes. After being forced to retreat, the Volunteer Army is left to pick up the pieces, and the alliance disintegrates. But even as the world seems to be succumbing to the dark influence of the Black King, a new hope emerges in the form of Aram, a young man with an unusual magical ability that could end up being the key to turning things around. Movie 1 (Episodes 1-4)","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2016-12-03","status":"Released","rating":7.5,"ratingCount":6,"genres":["Animazione","Azione","Avventura","Fantasy"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"85m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1325962,"name":"Daiki Yamashita","role":"Aram","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQNdJdZewk7VGP16ZNbpfJ9ZeMd.jpg"},{"id":992869,"name":"Ayane Sakura","role":"Phoena","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yPbTmntASE9psPIMhNGU5oo6vIH.jpg"},{"id":81244,"name":"Akira Ishida","role":"Yuri","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jnW2Gn2NlR2uwOCeyOuzypnTmkH.jpg"},{"id":1247771,"name":"Yuka Terasaki","role":"Aludra","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hMorHtbCmbDkznBr6P71qHk2rSL.jpg"},{"id":1221102,"name":"Yoshihisa Kawahara","role":"Burckhardt \t Burckhardt","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p7mhXGetLcnIT7zSd1kiJrbC1t8.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"Chain Chronicle: The Light of Haecceitas Movie 1","overview":"Yuri has assembled the Volunteer Army in an effort to defeat the Black King, who threatens to destroy the land with his Black Army, corrupting miasma, and nihilistic attitude. All the forces from assorted powers and races across the land of Yggdra have rallied behind his cause, but at the critical moment in what should be the final battle, Yuri and his allies are defeated by the Black King, the magical Chain Chronicle which records the history of the land is torn in half, and their sprite companion Pirika, who is the embodiment of the world's will, vanishes. After being forced to retreat, the Volunteer Army 